b/sc13giu.jpg"}, {"id": 1840992, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13gio.jpg"}], "slug": "deep-in-the-fields", "storyline": "You take on the role of Dani, a 24-year-old who has never lived outside a large city. He grew up surrounded by buses, buildings, and constant noise. The countryside was always something distant.\n\nIn the countryside, stories and superstitions still circulate\u2014things many people prefer not to talk about. Dani never believed in any of that. But when you're alone in the middle of nowhere, the legends start to feel real.\n\nNow, without a job and with nowhere to return after his mother kicked him out of the house, he accepts the only opportunity he finds: an online listing looking for a rural farmhand at an isolated stay somewhere in the interior of Buenos Aires.", "summary": "First-person walking simulator\nInspired by Argentine folklore and rural legends\nSimple interactions that reveal the story\nAtmospheric experience focused on narrative", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/deep-in-the-fields", "videos": [{"id": 184682, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "IQ6neU0heIE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IQ6neU0heIE", "title": "Deep in the Fields - Trailer 1", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IQ6neU0heIE/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}